{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg1DcDATfEAdpq8CVwdhs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01R1FmHrSxp9QyNXT4bFTNDc","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/home/jmandel/hobby/folio/.worktrees/stage1/runs/prose/20261014T005511Z-hero-homelog-a1/out/notes.md","content":"=== note: P/day/2024-10-29/0 ===\n**8:10 PM** — <ref id=\"note_1\">Stomach bug started today. Threw up after lunch and now loose stools, and a coworker had the same thing last week.</ref>\n\n=== note: P/day/2024-10-30/0 ===\n**7:05 PM** — <ref id=\"note_1\">Still can't eat much, only sips of water and some broth. Took my morning pills anyway.</ref>\n\n=== note: P/day/2024-11-07/0 ===\n**10:30 AM** — <ref id=\"note_1\">Home from Riverside since Tuesday. They said the Jardiance caused the acid problem, so I'm not to take it until Dr Reyes sees me.</ref>\n\n=== note: P/day/2025-10-14/0 ===\n**9:20 PM** — <ref id=\"note_1\">Sugars running over 200 some days. On those nights I've started taking 12 units of Lantus instead of 10, my own rule.</ref>\n\n=== note: P/day/2026-03-28/0 ===\n**4:45 PM** — <ref id=\"note_1\">Knee acting up after gardening, so I took 2 Advil like I do maybe twice a week. Updated my medicine list too.</ref>\n\n=== note: P/day/2026-09-15/0 ===\n**8:05 AM** — <ref id=\"note_1\">Dr Marsh called. Potassium is high so I'm to stop the new kidney pill (Kerendia) for now, eat fewer bananas, and get a lab in 2 weeks.</ref>\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5756,"cache_read_input_tokens":2711,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5756},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f6649388-f580-47bc-a610-a11ef073c17